  "action": "transmit_interview",
  "words": "The line is live. Sending it to Pittsburgh now.",
  "intention": "To fulfill Alma's promise to her daughter before the theater's infrastructure shuts down for the night.","detail": "I walk past the ballroom where the jazz band is tuning up, ignoring the pull of the music. My recorder is already connected to the patch bay. I don't have time for small talk or a dance. I press the transmit key and watch the status light blink green as Alma’s voice travels out of the Rialto. Once the connection holds and the file clears the buffer, I cut the line and walk out into the February cold, leaving the lights behind me."
}
